          "docs": "Creates a drift detection schedule for a stack using Pulumi Deployments. Drift detection identifies divergence between the declared infrastructure state in your Pulumi program and the actual state of resources in the cloud provider. The 'scheduleCron' field accepts a cron expression defining when drift detection should run (e.g. '0 */4 * * *' for every 4 hours). When 'autoRemediate' is set to true, a remediation update is automatically triggered to bring resources back into alignment with the de"
        },
        {
          "info": {
