            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Updates the configuration of an existing drift detection schedule. The request body can modify the cron expression controlling when drift detection runs and the autoRemediate flag that determines whether detected drift is automatically corrected by running an update operation. Auto-remediation requires a Business Critical subscription. Only future executions are affected; past drift detection runs are not modified."
        },
        {
