          "docs": "Returns all scheduled deployment actions configured for a stack. The response includes all schedule types: custom deployment schedules (cron-based recurring or one-time), drift detection schedules, and TTL (time-to-live) schedules. Each schedule in the response contains its ID, type, configuration (cron expression or timestamp), current status (active or paused), and the deployment request that will be executed on each run."
