          "docs": "Retrieves the full configuration and metadata for a specific scheduled deployment action. The response includes the schedule's ID, type (custom, drift, or TTL), timing configuration (cron expression or one-time timestamp), current status (active or paused), the deployment request that will be executed, and any type-specific fields such as autoRemediate for drift schedules or deleteAfterDestroy for TTL schedules."
